OL,3,GNEWSAGaelic school for 13 pupils could
OL,4,Aopen in the Scottish Borders
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new Gaelic primary school could open
OL,7,Fin the Scottish Borders where fewer
OL,8,Fthan 500 people speak, read and write
OL,9,Fthe language.
OL,11,FSenior councillors have agreed that the
OL,12,Fschool could open next summer on the
OL,13,Fcondition that the Scottish government
OL,14,Fagrees to fund the project.
OL,16,FFive pupils in primary one and eight in
OL,17,Fprimary two are initially expected to
OL,18,Fattend the single-class school in
OL,19,FPeeblesshire.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
